@startuml SD-LISTEN-07-playback-started-ack
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber
title SD-LISTEN-07: Cấp quyền Playback -> Âm thanh phát thực sự -> Sự kiện narration_started -> Tính lượt nghe Idempotent

actor "Du khách" as User
participant "Audio Player UI" as Player
participant "FastAPI Analytics Router" as Router
participant "AnalyticsIngestionService" as Svc
participant "AnalyticsRepository" as Repo
database "MongoDB\n(analytics_events &\npoi_daily_metrics)" as DB

User -> Player : Chọn điểm đến & Bấm ▶ Nghe
activate Player
Player -> Router : POST /api/v1/playback-grants (poi_id, tour_id, source="manual")
activate Router
Router --> Player : 200 OK {playback_id: "pb_abc123", stream_url: "..."}
deactivate Router

Player -> Player : audio.play()
note over Player
  Chỉ khi player kích hoạt sự kiện onplaying
  (đã buffer dữ liệu và thực sự phát âm thanh)
  mới phát sinh event narration_started.
end note
Player -> Player : onplaying event fired!

Player -> Router : POST /api/v1/analytics/events/batch\n{events: [{event_id: "ev_1", event_type: "narration_started", playback_id: "pb_abc123", poi_id: "poi_1"}]}
activate Router

Router -> Svc : ingest_events(events)
activate Svc

Svc -> Repo : ingest_events_batch(events)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB : insert_one(event_doc)
activate DB
DB --> Repo : inserted
deactivate DB

== Kiểm tra tính Idempotent của lượt nghe (BR-LISTEN-01) ==
Repo -> DB : find_one({playback_id: "pb_abc123", event_type: "narration_started", _id: {$ne: "ev_1"}})
activate DB
DB --> Repo : null (Chưa từng có sự kiện start nào trước đó cho playback_id này)
deactivate DB

Repo -> DB : update_one(\n  {_id: "poi_1_2026-09-19"},\n  {$inc: {listen_started_count: 1}, $addToSet: {unique_device_ids: device_id}},\n  upsert=True\n)
activate DB
DB --> Repo : updated (+1 lượt nghe)
deactivate DB

Repo --> Svc : {acks: [{event_id: "ev_1", status: "accepted"}]}
deactivate Repo
Svc --> Router : EventBatchResponse
deactivate Svc
Router --> Player : 200 OK {acks: [{event_id: "ev_1", status: "accepted"}]}
deactivate Router

Player -> Player : Xóa event ev_1 khỏi Local Outbox

== Trường hợp Pause / Resume hoặc Retry ==
User -> Player : Bấm Pause rồi Resume
note over Player
  Pause / Resume không cấp playback_id mới.
  Sự kiện narration_resumed KHÔNG làm tăng listen_started_count.
end note
@enduml
